  (title_block
    (title "Compact CM5 AI Camera")
    (comment 1 "Supersedes baseline prompt.md per 3 Nov owner directives (rea/owner_feedback.applied.md):")
    (comment 2 "6-layer 1.6mm stackup; J5 15-pin 1.0mm SFW15R-1STE1LF on 2-lane CAM0 + 50mm FFC 686615050001 + 8mm spacers;")
    (comment 3 "Parallel TPS259470ARPWR eFuses U4/U5 (C1=2.2uF 50V X7R, R5+D12 BAT54S+R19+C32->PMIC_ENABLE, U6 TPD6S300ARUKR 24V CC1/CC2 OVP, U3.3->GPIO26)")
    (comment 4 "Lion SU-06L-0165-GDM140-001 6L stackup (1oz outer/0.5oz inner, 0.19/0.45/0.19/0.45/0.19mm Dk=4.69/4.5); Diff90 0.230/0.1524mm, Diff100 0.180/0.1524mm; C8/10-12/34=GRM155R61E105KE11J, C2/3/19=CL10A226MP8NUNE/CL10A226MO7JZNC, R6/7/10/11=RC0402FR-0722KL")
